    <Shape Type="Text" CutIndex="1" Font="eufm10,-1,100,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" Str="DAILY CHORES&#10;───────────────&#10;- Make the bed (or at least flatten it)&#10;- Dishes in the sink? Handle it.&#10;- Wipe down counters and stove&#10;- Take out the trash if it smells like death&#10;- Feed yourself like a responsible adult&#10;- Quick sweep or vacuum where you walk most&#10;&#10;WEEKLY CHORES&#10;───────────────&#10;- Laundry (yes, even the hoodie)&#10;- Clean the bathroom sink and toilet&#10;- Change sheets (they’re not self-cleaning)&#10;- Mop or vacuum floors&#10;- Wipe down mirrors and TV&#10;- Empty fridge of science experiments&#10;&#10;────────────────────&#10;“Motivation fades. Dust doesn’t.”&#10;" H="7.9860077" LS="0" LnS="0" Ah="1" Av="1" Weld="1" HasBackupPath="1">
